<title>USA: Colorado Springs utility deal won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Colorado Springs utility deal won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Monday it won $66.7 million Colorado Springs, Colo., utilities system revenue bonds at a true interest cost of 5.862 percent.</p>
